cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "IONOGUARD: Reliable multi user direct to cell satellite assignment under ionospheric scintillation with conformal risk control"
authors:
  - family-names: "Arul Dalton"
    given-names: "G."
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-5981-7176"
    affiliation: "Saveetha Engineering College, Chennai, India"
repository-code: "https://github.com/iitrky/ionoguard"
license: MIT
abstract: "Code, trained models and result files for a predictive, reliability-calibrated controller that assigns users to LEO satellites and adapts link MCS for direct-to-cell access under equatorial plasma-bubble scintillation, with conformal risk control, online HARQ-driven risk control and Lagrangian performance bounds."
keywords:
  - direct-to-cell
  - LEO satellite
  - ionospheric scintillation
  - conformal risk control
  - user-satellite assignment
  - link adaptation
